WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.410
dare to take a break from the stunning revelations
from yesterday's impeachment hearing because

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:10.520
we have yet another important shocking but
not altogether surprising [inaudible]

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:16.500
in data point in the possible cognitive decline
being experienced by the president and you

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:22.620
know, every week it seems more and more clear
that something is very, very wrong.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:27.580
Early last week I told you about this book
called a warning, which is written by a senior

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:32.250
Trump staffer and many of you speculated that
the staffer might be Kellyanne Conway.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:33.250
We don't know.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:37.320
I don't have any news about that as far as
it goes, but we heard through a Washington

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:43.070
post preview last week about some of the concerning
as concerning cognitive decline related allegations

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:47.630
that were being made about Donald Trump regularly
slurring and stub stumbling around at the

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:50.060
white house and other allegations.

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:55.190
We now have more detail out of the book and
it is even worse than we imagined or have

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:56.809
been told up until now.

00:00:56.809 --> 00:01:03.920
So to catch you up, we already knew that this
book, a warning says quote, he stumbles, slurs

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:10.280
gets confused, is easily irritated and has
trouble synthesizing information.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:13.390
Not occasionally but with regularity.

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:16.680
But another element to this is Donald Trump's
memory.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:22.190
And these allegations actually mirror some
public facing events that we saw.

00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:23.950
I'll explain what I mean.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:28.950
Uh, staffers who deal with Trump regularly
are saying that they noticed that the president

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:34.229
quote also can't remember what he's said or
been told.

00:01:34.229 --> 00:01:38.850
Americans are used to him denying words that
have come out of his mouth according to this

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:40.460
senior official.

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:47.210
Sometimes this is to avoid responsibility,
but it often appears Trump genuinely doesn't

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:49.680
remember important facts.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:56.770
So when we see Trump lie in public, we assume
it is merely a deliberate lie.

00:01:56.770 --> 00:02:04.040
This book, a portion at least suggests that
Trump might genuinely not remember saying

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:05.920
the things that he says and then denies.

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:10.980
Now, I do have a word of caution here because
on the one hand, this would explain a lot.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:16.040
But on the other hand, I'm hearing from more
and more of you who believe that the unplanned

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:21.830
hospital visit the stuff about cognitive decline
in this book, that it may all be building

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:29.319
a setup for Trump to gracefully exit the presidency,
avoid losing reelection, avoid impeachment.

00:02:29.319 --> 00:02:35.030
So the idea is start a pretext of some kind
of cognitive or physical decline, which would

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:39.600
allow Trump to simply not run for reelection
and maybe better position Mike Pence, uh,

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:41.280
for the presidency in 2020.

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:45.860
I have no idea truly what's going on other
than the obvious, which is something is very

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.470
much wrong with the man.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:52.530
There's an example which you might remember,
remember this, there was a time a few months

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:54.750
ago where we had a hurricane.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:55.750
Hurricane was headed our way.

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:57.810
It was a category five hurricane.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:02.030
And I reported to you at the time that Donald
Trump said this really bizarre thing.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:05.849
He hasn't even heard of a category five hurricane
who's even heard of that.

00:03:05.849 --> 00:03:07.019
That's crazy.

00:03:07.019 --> 00:03:11.220
And we thought it was weird because it's not
just that most adults have heard of category

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:12.750
five hurricanes.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:17.959
Trump as president presided over numerous
category five hurricanes.

00:03:17.959 --> 00:03:23.540
The author of a warning argues that Trump
genuinely had no recollection of that.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:28.659
He had no memory of the multiple category
five hurricanes during his presidency and

00:03:28.659 --> 00:03:34.040
when he was told this is a category five hurricane
a few months ago, it sounded new to him.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.040
That is not good.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.040
Okay.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:40.849
If that is the explanation, something is very,
very wrong and you know, we started to see

00:03:40.849 --> 00:03:44.019
strange things before the election.

00:03:44.019 --> 00:03:48.550
Clearly it's gotten worse and worse since,
and these things can ramp up pretty quickly.

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:50.040
It's not funny.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:53.750
It's not sad, but it poses a national security
threat.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:59.180
And of course if there is a cover up of this
going on, that is also extraordinarily problematic

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:00.440
and disturbing.

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:01.440
More and more.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:05.610
The question is, if the decline continues,
how will Trump be doing by the time of the

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:10.790
debates with the eventual democratic presidential
nominee, will he hold it together?

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:14.230
Will it be evident that something is very
wrong on a national stage?

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.389
Will they try to limit the duration or number
of the debates?

00:04:17.389 --> 00:04:18.719
We don't know yet.

00:04:18.719 --> 00:04:20.049
We don't know the trajectory.

00:04:20.049 --> 00:04:24.569
We don't know the specifics of what's going
on, but people around Donald Trump are noticing,

00:04:24.569 --> 00:04:30.199
we're hearing this from a whole bunch of different
sources and at this point it's difficult to

00:04:30.199 --> 00:04:36.949
deny that something is going on and you know,
the, it's not, any of this stuff is not anything

00:04:36.949 --> 00:04:38.300
to make fun of.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:42.770
If it's a drug problem, that's an illness,
that's not something to make fun of.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:46.440
If it's cognitive decline, that's not something
to make fun of.

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:50.979
If there's some kind of physical health issue
that warranted that visit to the hospital,

00:04:50.979 --> 00:04:53.219
none of this stuff is to make fun of anyone.

00:04:53.219 --> 00:04:58.050
It's as voters, we deserve to know what is
going on.

00:04:58.050 --> 00:05:03.569
And if there is a proactive effort made to
obfuscate, then that is something that must

00:05:03.569 --> 00:05:05.550
be stopped immediately.

00:05:05.550 --> 00:06:52.960
We will see what we learn in the next week,
two weeks next month, who knows?

